{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-product","blocks":{"title":{"type":"title","settings":{}},"d4344a40-1c5b-400c-ae8f-fcdc24a5ef97":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/yotpo-product-reviews\/blocks\/star-rating\/eb7dfd7d-db44-4334-bc49-c893b51b36cf","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}},"caption":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"{{ product.metafields.descriptors.subtitle.value }}","text_style":"subtitle"}},"price":{"type":"price","settings":{}},"description":{"type":"description","settings":{}},"variant_picker":{"type":"variant_picker","settings":{"picker_type":"button"}},"92509ddc-3ec2-4529-b160-6e1da5dc9927":{"type":"link","settings":{"title":"{{ product.metafields.custom.link_to_title.value }}"}},"quantity_selector":{"type":"quantity_selector","settings":{}},"buy_buttons":{"type":"buy_buttons","settings":{"show_sticky_cart":true,"is_set":false,"only_tier_gang_button":"Required gang tier not reached","set_size":3,"set_text":"Wähle 3 Produkte","show_dynamic_checkout":false,"gang_url":""}},"wishlist_engine_product_page_eR9pyk":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/se-wishlist-engine\/blocks\/Product-Page\/8f7c0857-8e71-463d-a168-8e133094753b","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"bffe66cd-99d4-43eb-acd0-9850f187e77f":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/klarna-on-site-messaging\/blocks\/app-block\/b95936a9-74b6-4a95-8103-6a1b6459c25e","settings":{"data_key":"credit-promotion-badge","theme":"light","topPadding":"0","bottomPadding":"0","messagePrefix":""}},"recommended_products_TRmTRe":{"type":"recommended_products","settings":{"title":"Discover other moonshines","content":"","button_text":"Add all to cart","product_list":["vodka","tough-nut"],"enable_bulk_add":false,"columns_desktop":"2","enable_desktop_slider":false,"columns_mobile":"2","swipe_on_mobile":false}},"collapsible-row-0":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Description","icon":"clipboard","content":"<p>O'Donnell Moonshine <em>Aperitivo<\/em> is our take on the classic Italian aperitif. Forget the others, with Aperitivo, we've taken this Italian indulgence to a whole new level with the ultimate blend of fine herbs and premium Moonshine resulting in a deliciously <strong>bitter-sweet and fruity taste experience<\/strong>.<br\/><br\/>Whether enjoyed before a good dinner with friends, or on a sunny afternoon in the garden, our aperitif is ideal for any number of occasions. <\/p><p>Enjoy Aperitivo neat or as part of a Moonshine cocktail. You can find plenty of drinkspiration on our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\" title=\"Cocktails\">cocktails page<\/a>.<\/p><p>Bottled in traditional Mason Jars, we promise a unique drinking experience. If you would like to discover <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\">more high quality liqueurs<\/a>, have a look at our entire product range. Become part of our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/gang\" title=\"O'Donnell Gang\">Moonshine Gang<\/a> to collect proof points and unlock unique benefits.<\/p><p>For those new to Moonshine, it was the name given to illegally produced grain alcohol distilled during the American Prohibition. It was traditionally bottled in Mason Jars to avoid detection by the authorities. O’Donnell Moonshine retains the rebellious nature of that era, while delivering a whole new world of flavour in our range of smooth and delicious liqueurs.<\/p><h5>*Consult our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/faq\">FAQ's<\/a> for more information.<\/h5>","page":""}},"7a118c82-928c-48ad-b111-25c0dc4875e1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Moonshine Must-Haves","icon":"check_mark","content":"<p>1. Your jar of <a href=\"\/collections\/moonshine\" title=\"Moonshine\">Moonshine<\/a>.<\/p><p>2. Our reusable <a href=\"\/products\/pouring-lid\" title=\"Pouring Lid\">Pouring Lid<\/a> to not waste a drop.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Perfect Serve","icon":"bottle","content":"<h3>Aperitivo Spritz<\/h3><h4>Ingredients<\/h4><ul><li>150ml Prosecco<\/li><li>50ml Aperitivo<\/li><li>10ml sparkling water<\/li><li>Lime slice or zest for garnish<\/li><li>Ice<\/li><\/ul><h4>Recipe<\/h4><ul><li>Fill a tall wine glass with ice.<\/li><li>Add Prosecco.<\/li><li>Add Aperitivo.<\/li><li>Add sparkling water.<\/li><li>Stir gently.<\/li><li>Garnish with a lime wedge or zest.<\/li><li>Serve and enjoy!<\/li><\/ul><p>You can find more recipes <a href=\"\/blogs\/cocktails\" title=\"Cocktails\">here<\/a>.<\/p>","page":""}},"32b786d6-269a-4f91-b1c1-1127d452915e":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Our Loyalty Scheme - The Gang","icon":"silhouette","content":"<p>Join our loyalty scheme 'The Gang' <a href=\"\/pages\/gang\" title=\"O'Donnell Gang\">here<\/a> to earn points, receive some amazing rewards and gain early access to exciting new products!<\/p>","page":""}},"306ee80a-abbf-4074-92bc-03e3130ac128":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Allergens","icon":"nut_free","content":"<p>All of our spirits are produced using wheat based alcohol. While the distillation process removes gluten from the final product, individuals with certain conditions (i.e coeliac disease) may wish to exercise caution prior to purchase.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-2":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Shipping","icon":"truck","content":"<p><strong>£3.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&lt; <\/strong>2kg<br\/><strong>£5.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&gt; <\/strong>2kg<\/p><p><strong>Free shipping<\/strong> for orders over £70!<\/p><p>Shipping cost to Northern Ireland is set at £16.95<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["title","d4344a40-1c5b-400c-ae8f-fcdc24a5ef97","caption","price","description","variant_picker","92509ddc-3ec2-4529-b160-6e1da5dc9927","quantity_selector","buy_buttons","wishlist_engine_product_page_eR9pyk","bffe66cd-99d4-43eb-acd0-9850f187e77f","recommended_products_TRmTRe","collapsible-row-0","7a118c82-928c-48ad-b111-25c0dc4875e1","collapsible-row-